 behaviour of malaria patients in a Kenyan rural community.</article-title><source>Social Science and Medicine</source><volume>54</volume><fpage>377</fpage><lpage>386</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11824914</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0001788-Agyepong1"><label>23</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Agyepong</surname><given-names>IA</given-names></name><name><surname>Manderson</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name></person-group><year>1994</year><article-title>The diagnosis and Management of fever at Household level in the Greater Accra Region, Ghana.</article-title><source>Acta Trop.</source><volume>58</volume><fpage>317</fpage><lpage>330</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">7709870</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0001788-Glik1"><label>24</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Glik</surname><given-names>DC</given-names></name><name><surname>Ward</surname><given-names>WB</given-names></name><name><surname>Gordon</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Haba</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name></person-group><year>1989</year><article-title>Malaria treatment practices among mothers in Guinea.</article-title><source>Journal of Health and Social Behavior</source><volume>30</volume><fpage>426</fpage><lpage>456</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0001788-Stein1"><label>25</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Stein</surname><given-names>CM</given-names></name><name><surname>Gora</surname><given-names>NP</given-names></name><name><surname>Macheka</surname><given-names>BM</given-names></name></person-group><year>1988</year><article-title>Self medication with chloroquine for malaria prophylaxis in urban and rural Zimbabweans.</article-title><source>Trop Geograph Med</source><volume>40</volume><fpage>264</fpage><lpage>268</lpage></citation></ref><ref 